### ==========================================
### 1. CREATE ENTITY LIST
### ==========================================

### Create a new EntityList with initial items
POST {{url}}/entitylists
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bucket List 2026",
  "subtitle": "Things to achieve before the year ends",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE",
  "items": [
    "Visit the Grand Canyon",
    "Publish Atlas v1.0 backend",
    "Learn native Java HttpClient"
  ]
}

### Create second EntityList with initial items
POST {{url}}/entitylists
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My favourite albums",
  "subtitle": "A list of the albums that mean a lot to me",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "items": [
    "Blonde",
    "I forget where we were",
    "The great divide"
  ]
}

###

### ==========================================
### 2. READ / FETCH ENTITY LISTS
### ==========================================

### Get all EntityLists owned by current user
GET {{url}}/entitylists
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a random EntityList for current user
GET {{url}}/entitylists/random
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific EntityList by ID
GET {{url}}/entitylists/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ==========================================
### 3. UPDATE ENTITY LIST
### ==========================================

### Update EntityList (modifies metadata & replaces items)
PUT {{url}}/entitylists/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Bucket List 2026",
  "subtitle": "Refined goals for late 2026",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "items": [
    "Visit the Grand Canyon",
    "Publish Atlas v1.0 backend",
    "Learn native Java HttpClient",
    "Complete frontend UI integration"
  ]
}

###

### ==========================================
### 4. DELETE ENTITY LIST
### ==========================================

### Delete EntityList by ID (also deletes orphaned items)
DELETE {{url}}/entitylists/1
Authorization: {{JWT}}
Accept: application/json